<p class="fiction-notice">Andrei Volkov, his colleagues, and the files he investigates are fictional. The events of August 1991 are real: anything stamped <span class="stamp-inline">ИСТОРИЧЕСКАЯ СПРАВКА</span> opens a historical note with its sources.</p>
<p class="title-credit">A Digital Humanities project · University of Tennessee · Prototype, November 2026</p>
